OL,3,GNEWSANew play space opens in park
OL,4,
OL,5,FA new natural play space with sand
OL,6,Fdunes has opened in Jersey.
OL,8,FCoronation Park in St Lawrence has been
OL,9,Fextended into neighbouring playing
OL,10,Ffields after plans were approved in
OL,11,FApril.
OL,13,FThe #280,000 project also included
OL,14,Ffootpaths linking the two parks, and
OL,15,Fnew trees and flower beds had been
OL,16,Fplanted, project leaders said. Children
OL,17,Fran inside to play as soon as the
OL,18,Fribbon was cut.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
